T07:52:59.000Z", "edit_history_tweet_ids": ["2114263942411211108"], "id": "2114263942411211108", "public_metrics": {"bookmark_count": 0, "impression_count": 13, "like_count": 0, "quote_count": 0, "reply_count": 0, "retweet_count": 0}, "text": "I love how the $2b Treasury intervention was a\n\"liquidity measure\" until yields didn't fall.\nThen we doubled it, hinted we'd go bigger, said we had \"asymmetric information,\" and pointed at the $1 trillion TGA as a backstop.", "url": "https://x.com/techimportsuk/status/2114263942411211108"}, {"author_id": "1767733346006683648", "created_at": "2026-10-24T22:18:25.000Z", "edit_history_tweet_ids": ["2114119346167435697"], "id": "2114119346167435697", "public_metrics": {"bookmark_count": 0, "impression_count": 27, "like_count": 0, "quote_count": 0, "reply_count": 0, "retweet_count": 0}, "text": "At geogf kingley can you start doing an in memoriam at tga for companies that shut down thank you", "url": "https://x.com/SubbiMaddi/status/2114119346167435697"}, {"author_id": "1942296730026008579", "created_at": "2026-10-24T22:00:00.000Z", "edit_history_tweet_ids": ["2114114714603340046"], "entities": {"urls": [{"display_url": "pic.x.com/TN38Kx10m4", "end": 211, "expanded_url": "https://x.com/WithAScalpel/status/2114114714603340046/photo/1", "media_key": "3_2113969604036890624", "start": 188, "url": "https://t.co/TN38Kx10m4"}, {"display_url": "x.com/alex1708ander/…", "end": 235, "expanded_url": "https://twitter.com/alex1708ander/status/2112922668756292007", "start": 212, "url": "https://t.co/uStvWcp6u5"}]}, "id": "2114114714603340046", "public_metrics": {"bookmark_count": 13, "impression_count": 1524, "like_count": 30, "quote_count": 0, "reply_count": 0, "retweet_count": 7}, "referenced_tweets": [{"id": "2112922668756292007", "type": "quoted"}], "text": "Senning Procedure—Atrial Switch🔄\n\n👉VA discordance (d-TGA) → Systemic RV after Senning procedure.\n👉AV and VA discordance (ccTGA) → Systemic LV after arterial switch and Senning pr